{"3397400": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Frick It", "steam_appid": 3397400, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are part of a mining team. One day on the mission, the ground collapses beneath you, and your crew falls into the abyss. With your systems barely intact, you stumble upon something unexpected: the last living plant capable of bringing life back to the surface. Delivering it to the people above becomes your only purpose now.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each layer of the pit is more dangerous than the last, and the only way through is by building vehicles. To do that, you'll complete the unfinished blueprints and parts left behind by the robots who fell just before you, who never made it out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chop trees, mine ores, and trade with the Silly Villagers. Avoid dangerous monsters with your friends and customize your vehicle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I'm a solo developer building this game in every spare moment I have. Your support truly means a lot, add it to your wishlist to help make it happen. Thank you!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are part of a mining team. One day on the mission, the ground collapses beneath you, and your crew falls into the abyss. With your systems barely intact, you stumble upon something unexpected: the last living plant capable of bringing life back to the surface. Delivering it to the people above becomes your only purpose now.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each layer of the pit is more dangerous than the last, and the only way through is by building vehicles. To do that, you'll complete the unfinished blueprints and parts left behind by the robots who fell just before you, who never made it out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chop trees, mine ores, and trade with the Silly Villagers. Avoid dangerous monsters with your friends and customize your vehicle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I'm a solo developer building this game in every spare moment I have. Your support truly means a lot, add it to your wishlist to help make it happen. Thank you!</p>", "short_description": "Survive with your friends in the depths of a massive pit. Scavenge parts, trade with silly villagers, upgrade your vehicle, fight deadly creatures, and uncover the stories of the robots who fell before you. Fly your way back to the surface.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397400/dea5569212b5649c1812e02c4a78bfc5eed440cc/header.jpg?t=1783072185", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397400/1aa12c696f783b9a1d2c0c9618ed769cd042dea2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1783072185", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397400/1aa12c696f783b9a1d2c0c9618ed769cd042dea2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1783072185", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> İntel i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1050<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> İntel i7<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> RTX 3050<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\">